('apple-usbc-to-usbc-woven-2m', 'Apple USB-C to USB-C Woven Charge Cable 2m - Midnight Black', 'accessories', 22000, 21500, 17500, 120, 0.07, '/assets/products/apple-usbc-woven-2m.webp', 'Apple''s premium braided USB-C cable with a durable woven design that resists tangling and fraying. Supports up to 240W charging and USB 3.2 Gen 2 data transfer at 10Gbps. The reinforced strain relief extends cable life through thousands of plug cycles.', 1, unixepoch('2026-06-16'), 1, 17500, '/assets/products/apple-usbc-woven-2m.webp', 20500, 4.7, 1, 'Apple', 1, 1),

